    <solution><m>f'(x) &gt; 0</m> for <m>x \lt  -2</m>, the first segment must be
one of 1, 8, or 9.  Similarly, because <m>f'(x) \lt  0</m> for <m>-2 \lt  x \lt  2</m>,
the second segment must be one of 2, 4, or 6.  And lastly, the third segment
must be 1, 8, or 9.



